  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation phase of CMIS for the Kosovo Judiciary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned effect on society is the further consolidation of a transparent, accountable and trustworthy judicial system, with:
&#x2022;	Effective court and prosecutors&apos; offices, with procedures and timelines for completing cases as per recognized human rights standards. 
&#x2022;	Improved human resources, management, budget planning for courts and prosecutors&apos; offices, based on accurate and real-time statistical data.</narrative>
  </description>
